</ul>
<p>Read more on our <a href="/new-patients/">new patients page</a>.</p>

<h2>Preventive care at home</h2>
<ul class="checklist">
  <li>Brush twice a day for two minutes with a fluoride toothpaste</li>
  <li>Clean between your teeth once a day with floss, picks or a water flosser</li>
  <li>Limit sipping on sugary or acidic drinks throughout the day</li>
  <li>Wear a <a href="/services/tmj-night-guards/">night guard</a> if you grind, and a mouthguard for contact sports</li>
</ul>

